      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Versailles%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Ripley County Courthouse and Tyson United Methodist Church sit on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
