      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Versailles%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A post office has operated in Versailles since 1823, marking its long‑standing community hub.",
